<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4545" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aurĕŏlus</span></b> , a,
		um, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>adj.
				dim.</i> [aureus]. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Of gold</i>, <i>golden</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">anellus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Ep. 5, 1, 34</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ensiculus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Rud. 4, 4, 112</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corona,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Exod. 25, 25</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">30, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">37, 27</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">malum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat. 2,
					12</span></i>
			.—Hence, <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">au-rĕŏlus</span></b> ,
				i, m. (sc. nummus), <i>a
				gold coin</i>, <i><span class="en">Mart. 5, 19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">12,
			36</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Covered</i> or <i>ornamented with
			gold</i>, <i>gilded</i>: cinctus, Lucil. ap.
					<i><span class="en">Non. p. 553, 2</span></i>: laquearia,
			Prud. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ στεφ</span>. 9,
			196.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>Gold-colored</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">collum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 3, 9, 4</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">color,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					9, 3, 2</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>golden</i>, <i>splendid</i>, <i>brilliant</i>, <i>beautiful</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aureoli pedes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					61, 163</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">non magnus, verum aureolus et ad verbum
					ediscendus libellus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Ac. 2, 44, 135</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oratiuncula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					N. D. 3, 17, 43</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
